---
const siteName = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_SITE_NAME || 'Drive-Insight';
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
const lang = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_SITE_LANG || 'en';

const aiDisclosure = lang === 'ko'
  ? '본 사이트의 콘텐츠는 AI 도구의 보조를 받아 작성됩니다. 모든 데이터는 1차 자료에서 검증되며, 본문 인용 링크로 직접 확인할 수 있습니다.'
  : 'Content on this site is produced with AI assistance and editorial review. Automotive claims are checked against primary sources where available.';
const affiliateDisclosure = lang === 'ko'
  ? '제휴 링크가 포함될 수 있으며, 구매가 발생하면 일정액의 수수료를 받을 수 있습니다.'
  : 'Some pages may include affiliate links. If a purchase occurs, Drive-Insight may earn a commission at no additional cost to the reader.';
---

<footer class="mt-16 border-t border-border bg-black/25">
  <div class="site-shell py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-4">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="inline-grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded border border-primary/40 bg-primary/10 text-primary" aria-hidden="true">DI</span>
          <h3 class="font-extrabold text-lg" style="font-family: var(--font-heading)">{siteName}</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">{import.meta.env.PUBLIC_SITE_DESCRIPTION || 'Automotive safety, reliability, and ownership intelligence.'}</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-foreground">Archive</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          <li><a href="/posts" class="hover:text-primary">Reports</a></li>
          <li><a href="/data" class="hover:text-primary">Data Hub</a></li>
          <li><a href="/garage" class="hover:text-primary">My Garage</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-foreground">Trust</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-primary">About</a></li>
          <li><a href="/editorial-process" class="hover:text-primary">Editorial Process</a></li>
          <li><a href="/editorial-standards" class="hover:text-primary">Editorial Standards</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-primary">Privacy Policy</a></li>
          <li><a href="/affiliate-disclosure" class="hover:text-primary">Affiliate Disclosure</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-foreground">Safety boundary</h4>
        <p class="text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Drive-Insight is an editorial resource, not a repair shop, insurer, dealer, or recall authority. Confirm safety work with official manufacturer and NHTSA channels.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 rounded border border-border bg-background/70 p-4 text-xs leading-5 text-muted-foreground">
      <strong class="block text-foreground">AI / affiliate disclosure</strong>
      <p class="mt-1">{aiDisclosure}</p>
      <p class="mt-1">{affiliateDisclosure}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted-foreground md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between">
      <p>© {currentYear} {siteName}. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>Obsidian Archive redesign · Astro + Tailwind</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
